### Automatic startup configuration

Use a dedicated Windows service installed by the signed installer.

Recommended behavior:

| Setting        | Value                    |
| -------------- | ------------------------ |
| Startup type   | Automatic                |
| Recovery       | Restart on failure       |
| Server binding | Local LAN, authenticated |
| Default mode   | Monitoring               |
| Routing mode   | User-controlled          |
| Exit behavior  | Restore network state    |

