* Stage 5 – Load balancing

    Implement interface-aware sockets, per-flow routing, weighted scheduling and failover.

    Deliverable: Multiple independent network sessions.

* Stage 6 – Streaming engine

    Implement traffic profiles, application selection and QoS.

    Deliverable: Streaming optimization.

* Stage 7 – Android application

    Implement device pairing, network status, VPN service and tunnel client.

    Deliverable: Android client.

* Stage 8 – Windows VPN and gateway

    Implement virtual network adapter, routing, forwarding and firewall integration.

    Deliverable: Full-device traffic routing.

* Stage 9 – True bonding

    Add multiple QUIC paths, remote relay, packet sequencing and reassembly.

    Deliverable: Supported single-flow bandwidth aggregation.

* Stage 10 – Public release

    Testing, signing, privacy documentation, installers and distribution.

    Deliverable: NetFusion public release candidate.

